      <div class="alert a-info small">Member-wise dues and advances always print as <b>Schedule A / Schedule B</b> on a separate page of the Balance Sheet (and a separate sheet in Excel); the Balance Sheet itself shows one total for each. Each report page also has a <b>Format</b> drop-down to print a different format once.</div>
